    <mxCell id="restrBox" value="&lt;b&gt;Restraint Correction (required to remove artefact energy from decoupling)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;① ΔG_restr_on: free energy cost of applying DBC restraints while ligand is still interacting (computed numerically from simulation)&lt;br&gt;② ΔG_restr_analytical: Boresch standard-state correction — releases restrained ghost ligand to 1 M standard concentration (computed analytically from force constants)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF9E7;strokeColor=#D35400;fontColor=#1A252F;fontSize=11;arcSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
